00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.300
When we can take the benefit of NCB?

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:18.860
If the policy of your vehicle is Expired.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.400
Then, will you get the benefit of NCB?

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.680
If you have sold out your vehicle, what will happen to NCB?

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.700
Will  NCB discount will be transferred to you or..

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:30.440
the NCB will be transferred to the person who purchased the vehicle.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:35.480
While the renewal of the policy we have the option to choose NCB,

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.920
So, if we select more NCB, then what will happen?

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:40.900
The policy will be cancelled or we will have to face any problem?

